# .NET build output in the mission starters. These are regenerated by
# `dotnet build` and are deliberately NOT added as a .gitignore inside each
# starter: that file would change the starter bundle, and therefore its
# release-asset checksum, after V3 was already published.
projects/*/starter/**/bin/
projects/*/starter/**/obj/
